    "detailed_description": "\u2022 Online Multiplayer: Compete and collaborate with players from around the world. Do you have what it takes to be the king of the wheelie?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Amazing Tricks: Perfect your skills and perform the most impressive wheelies. Show your skill and earn extra points for your unique style!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Maps: Explore the maps, Drive, Wheelie and avoid losing your Maneuver with obstacles, Explore and find the best route to show your perfect Record.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Customization: Upgrade and customize your Motorcycle and Character to stand out from the crowd. The more you play, the more you unlock!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Competitive Rankings: Get on the podium with our daily, weekly and monthly rankings. Compete against the best and show your name at the top of the leaderboards!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Daily Challenges: Take part in exciting daily challenges to earn rewards and improve your ranking.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Special Events: Join special events with unique game modes and exclusive prizes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to become a wheelie legend? Race ON RUBBER and prove that you are the best on the asphalt!",
